        G -->|recentBudget=4800| I[选中最近消息]
        G -->|剩余budget| J[选中检索结果]
        H --> K[renderContextPrompt]
        I --> K
        J --> K
        K --> L[存储ContextSnapshot]
        L --> M([返回snapshot])
